.claude/
CLAUDE.md

# Pre-re-encode source video (MPEG-4 Part 2, no browser decodes it). Kept on
# disk as the master copy; the deck ships the H.264 re-encode beside it.
JEPA/cifar10_jepa_projection.mp4
# Superseded by I-JEPA.jpg, which is what the deck references.
JEPA/I-JEPA.png

# PDF export intermediates (see build-pdf.py). _printfonts holds static, unwrapped
# copies of the vendored webfonts -- Chrome's PDF backend will not embed variable
# fonts or woff wrappers -- and is a rebuildable cache, not a source asset.
_printfonts/
_print-flat.html

# Generated by build-pdf.py from generative-sketching.html. Regenerable, and a
# near-duplicate of the deck -- tracking it would double every deck diff, and the
# Pages workflow publishes the whole repo, so it would also put a second, subtly
# different copy of the talk at a public URL.
generative-sketching-print.html

# Local working material, deliberately unpublished. Same reason: everything committed
# here is served by GitHub Pages, and these are superseded drafts.
#   examples/  -- earlier standalone prototypes of the deck's visualisations, plus
#                 an older draft of the talk (examples/index.html).
#   imdb.txt   -- `wc -l` over the IMDb CSVs, the provenance of the 74,190,187 rows
#                 quoted on the Join Order Benchmark slide.
examples/
imdb.txt
